Let $U(z)\in(\mf g\otimes\mc V)[[z^{-1}]]z^{-1}$ and $h(z)\in(\mf h\otimes\mc V)[[z^{-1}]]$ be a solution of equation <<ref:L0>>. Then the formal power series $F(z)\in(\mf g\otimes\mc V)[[z^{-1}]]$ defined in <<ref:eq:F>> (where $a\in Z(\mf h)$) satisfies condition (C3) above, namely $F(z)=\frac{\delta f(z)}{\delta u}$, where

\begin{equation}
\tint f(z)=\tint\kappa(a\otimes1\mid h(z))\in\quot{\mc V}{\partial\mc V}[[z^{-1}]]\,.
\end{equation}
